msgstr "收银系统里应该还有。等一下，我查查。"

#. Key:	ArrivalContractPrintedRead
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3065)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3065)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalContractPrintedRead"
msgid "지상 4층. 옥상은 같이 쓰되, 창고랑 기계실은 들어가지 말라고 돼 있네."
msgstr "地上4层。天台是共用的，但上面的仓库和机房不让进。"

#. Key:	ArrivalToolBoxMemory
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3080)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3080)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalToolBoxMemory"
msgid "이거 들 때마다 오빠가 밑에 받치라고 했는데. 손잡이 끊어진다고."
msgstr "每次搬这个，哥都让我从底下托着。说提手会断。"

#. Key:	Arrival402VacantThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3101)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3101)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Arrival402VacantThought"
msgid "빈집이라더니. 메모만 붙어 있네."
msgstr "说是没人住。只贴着一张纸条。"

#. Key:	ArrivalRoofClinkCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3174)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3174)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalRoofClinkCaption"
msgid "쇠붙이 내려놓는 소리"
msgstr "放下金属物品的声音"

#. Key:	ArrivalRoofRationalize
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3195)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3195)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalRoofRationalize"
msgid "창고에서 짐 정리하나 보네."
msgstr "像是有人在仓库里收拾东西。"

#. Key:	UsedListingMemoThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3352)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3352)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,UsedListingMemoThought"
msgid "관리실 책상 메모에 있던 그 거래네. 8월 12일, 3만 원."
msgstr "就是管理室桌上便条记的那笔交易。8月12日，3万韩元。"

#. Key:	UsedListingThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3356)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3356)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,UsedListingThought"
msgid "오빠 공구랑 똑같다. 판 사람이… ‘달빛’?"
msgstr "跟哥的工具一模一样。卖家的昵称是……“月光”？"

#. Key:	RearDoorCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3381)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3381)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,RearDoorCaption"
msgid "철문 닫히는 소리"
msgstr "铁门关上的声音"

#. Key:	StoreReceiptThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3401)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3401)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,StoreReceiptThought"
msgid "오빠가 부탁했다고?"
msgstr "我哥托他的？"

#. Key:	StoreTerminalCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3459)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3459)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,StoreTerminalCaption"
msgid "[계산대 단말기를 삑삑 누르는 소리]"
msgstr "［收银终端嘀嘀的按键声］"

#. Key:	NarinReceiptFound
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3492)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3492)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinReceiptFound"
msgid "작년 8월 2일이네요. 건물주 아저씨가 대신 받아 가셨어요. 한 장 뽑아 드릴게요."
msgstr "去年8月2日。是房东大叔代领的。我给你打一张出来。"

#. Key:	StorePrinterCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3560)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3560)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,StorePrinterCaption"
msgid "[영수증이 뽑혀 나오다 딸깍 잘리는 소리]"
msgstr "［小票打出来，咔嗒一声切断］"

#. Key:	NarinReceiptHere
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3576)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3576)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinReceiptHere"
msgid "여기 있어요."
msgstr "给你。"

#. Key:	NarinDeliveryAnswer
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3608)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3608)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinDeliveryAnswer"
msgid "작년 여름에 몇 번 맡겼어요. 마지막 건 건물주 아저씨가 찾아가셨고요. 오빠분이 부탁했다고 하던데요."
msgstr "去年夏天放过几次。最后一件是房东大叔来取走的。他说是你哥托他的。"

#. Key:	NarinLineLastDayReceipt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3624)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3624)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLineLastDayReceipt"
msgid "그 영수증 잘 챙겨 둬요. 필요하면 저도 본 대로 말할게요. 무슨 일 있으면 바로 이쪽으로 오세요."
msgstr "那张小票收好。需要的话，我也会照实说。有什么事就直接过来。"

#. Key:	NarinLineLastDay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3629)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3629)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLineLastDay"
msgid "아직은요. 저 오늘도 밤새 있으니까, 무슨 일 있으면 바로 이쪽으로 오세요."
msgstr "还没有呢。我今天也在这儿通宵，有什么事就直接过来。"

#. Key:	NarinLineRoof
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3638)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3638)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLineRoof"
msgid "옥상요? 작년 여름에 건물주 아저씨가 자물쇠를 싹 바꿨대요. 열쇠는 관리실에나 있을걸요."
msgstr "天台？听说去年夏天房东大叔把锁全换了。钥匙大概只有管理室才有吧。"

#. Key:	NarinLineMilk
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3645)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3645)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLineMilk"
msgid "아직 소식 없으세요? 아, 오빠분 올 때마다 바나나우유를 두 개씩 사 가셨어요. 하나는 꼭 가방 앞주머니에 넣고요."
msgstr "还是没有消息吗？啊，你哥每次来都会买两瓶香蕉牛奶，有一瓶一定放进包前面的口袋里。"

#. Key:	NarinLineMidWeek
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3652)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3652)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLineMidWeek"
msgid "아직 소식 없으세요? 저도 단골들한테 물어봤는데, 최근에 봤다는 사람은 없더라고요."
msgstr "还没有消息吗？我也问了几个老顾客，都说最近没见过他。"

#. Key:	NarinRepeatAnswer
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3659)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3659)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinRepeatAnswer"
msgid "지금은 그 정도예요. 다른 손님들한테도 한번 물어볼게요."
msgstr "我现在知道的就这些。我再帮你问问别的客人。"

#. Key:	ArrivalNarinLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3664)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3664)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalNarinLine"
msgid "큰 가방 메고 다니시던 분이죠? 작년 여름부터 못 봤어요. 근데 403호에 오셨구나. 1년 새 세 번째예요, 그 집. 옆집은 봄부터 비어 있고요."
msgstr "是总背着大包的那位吧？去年夏天以后就没见过了。你住403啊？那间一年里都换第三个租客了，隔壁从春天就一直空着。"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveExplore
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3702)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3702)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveExplore"
msgid "짐 풀고 빌라와 편의점 둘러보기"
msgstr "整理行李，去公寓和便利店转转"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveContract
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3706)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3706)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveContract"
msgid "책상 위 임대차계약서 보기"
msgstr "看桌上的租房合同"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveBoxes
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3710)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3710)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveBoxes"
msgid "오빠가 남긴 짐 살펴보기"
msgstr "查看哥哥留下的东西"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveStore
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3714)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3714)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveStore"
msgid "편의점 직원에게 오빠 소식 묻기"
msgstr "向便利店店员打听哥哥的消息"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveNeighbors
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3719)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3719)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveNeighbors"
msgid "401호, 402호 앞 살펴보기"
msgstr "看看401室和402室门口"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveRoof
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3723)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3723)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveRoof"
msgid "계약서에 적힌 옥상 문 확인하기"
msgstr "去看合同里写的天台门"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveSleep
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3725)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3725)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveSleep"
msgid "403호로 돌아가서 자기"
msgstr "回403室睡觉"

#. Key:	BaselineStairsCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3932)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3932)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,BaselineStairsCaption"
msgid "계단을 내려가는 발소리"
msgstr "下楼梯的脚步声"

#. Key:	BaselinePipeCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3960)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3960)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,BaselinePipeCaption"
msgid "벽 속 배관으로 물 내려가는 소리"
msgstr "墙里水管的流水声"

#. Key:	BaselineDoorCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4014)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4014)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,BaselineDoorCaption"
msgid "현관문 닫히는 소리"
msgstr "谁家关门的声音"

#. Key:	NightOneSolvedThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4239)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4239)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightOneSolvedThought"
msgid "…위에 뭐가 있어."
msgstr "……上面有东西。"

#. Key:	NightOneAboveThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4346)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4346)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightOneAboveThought"
msgid "형광등 우는 소리야. 이 위에 불 켜진 데가 있어."
msgstr "是日光灯嗡嗡响的声音。这上面有个亮着灯的地方。"

#. Key:	NightOneAboveKnockCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4373)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4373)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightOneAboveKnockCaption"
msgid "천장에서 한 번 두드리는 소리"
msgstr "天花板传来一下敲击声"

#. Key:	NightRestPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4392)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4392)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightRestPrompt"
msgid "아침까지 쉬기"
msgstr "休息到天亮"

#. Key:	NightRestBlocked
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4417)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4417)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightRestBlocked"
msgid "아직 밖에 뭐가 있어. 지금은 못 누워."
msgstr "外面还有东西。现在不能躺下。"

#. Key:	ReportSentSpeaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4701)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4701)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ReportSentSpeaker"
msgid "보낸 문자"
msgstr "发出的短信"

#. Key:	EvictionPhotoSent
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4702)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4702)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EvictionPhotoSent"
msgid "[사진] 관리인이 문에 붙인 종이입니다. 내일 오전 7시에 옥상 누수 공사를 한답니다. 그 전에 5층 벽을 꼭 확인해 주세요."
msgstr "[图片] 这是管理员贴在门上的纸，说是明天上午7点要修天台漏水。请一定在那之前查看五楼的墙。"

#. Key:	EvictionDeadlineThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4716)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4716)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EvictionDeadlineThought"
msgid "일곱 시에 벽을 덮으면… 그 전에 와 줄 수 있을까."
msgstr "七点就要把墙封上了……他们来得及吗？"

#. Key:	FirstReportSignalThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4739)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4739)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportSignalThought"
msgid "신호 잡힌다. 112에 문자부터 보내자."
msgstr "有信号了。先给112发短信。"

#. Key:	FirstReportSentCover
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4749)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4749)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportSentCover"
msgid "무영로 27-3 달빛빌라입니다. 옥상에 방이 하나 있어요. 작년 7월에 실종된 오빠 백도하가 살던 곳인데, 벽 안에서 두드리는 소리가 나요. 사람일 수도 있어요. 벽 옆 배관 점검구도 누가 덮개를 떼어 가고 막아 놨어요. 그 덮개는 제가 갖고 있어요. 와 주세요."
msgstr "这里是无影路27-3号月光公寓。天台上有个房间，我哥白道夏去年7月失踪前住在那儿。墙里传出敲击声，里面可能有人。墙边的管道检修口也被人拆了盖板，封上了。那块盖板在我这儿。请派人过来。"

#. Key:	FirstReportSent
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4753)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4753)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportSent"
msgid "무영로 27-3 달빛빌라입니다. 옥상에 방이 하나 있어요. 작년 7월에 실종된 오빠 백도하가 살던 곳인데, 벽 안에서 두드리는 소리가 나요. 사람일 수도 있어요. 와 주세요."
msgstr "这里是无影路27-3号月光公寓。天台上有个房间，我哥白道夏去年7月失踪前住在那儿。墙里传出敲击声，里面可能有人。请派人过来。"

#. Key:	ReportSpeaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4772)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4772)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ReportSpeaker"
msgid "112"
msgstr "112"

#. Key:	FirstReportReceipt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4773)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4773)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportReceipt"
msgid "[112 문자신고] 신고가 접수됐습니다. 담당 경찰관이 확인 후 연락드리겠습니다."
msgstr "[112短信报警] 您的报警已受理。负责民警核实后会与您联系。"

#. Key:	SiteCheckSpeaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4795)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4795)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,SiteCheckSpeaker"
msgid "무영경찰서 실종수사팀"
msgstr "无影警察署失踪调查组"

#. Key:	FirstReportSiteCheck
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4796)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4796)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportSiteCheck"
msgid "옥탑은 확인했습니다. 지금은 안에서 소리나 움직임이 없어요. 보내 주신 자료로 추가 확인 중입니다. 다시 소리가 나면 바로 연락 주시고, 벽에는 손대지 마세요."
msgstr "楼顶房间我们已经查看过了，目前里面没有声音或动静。您发来的材料还在进一步核实。如果再听到声音，请马上联系我们，也请不要动那面墙。"

#. Key:	FirstReportDispatch
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4865)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4865)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportDispatch"
msgid "순찰 경찰관이 지금 그쪽으로 가고 있습니다. 옥상은 관리인분이 열어 주기로 했어요."
msgstr "巡逻民警正在赶往您那边。管理员答应帮忙打开天台门。"

#. Key:	SiteCheckGoUpThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4874)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4874)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,SiteCheckGoUpThought"
msgid "옥상에 먼저 올라가 있자."
msgstr "先上天台等着吧。"

#. Key:	ArrivalSleepBlocked
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5136)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5136)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalSleepBlocked"
msgid "아직 볼 게 남았어."
msgstr "还有东西没看完。"

#. Key:	SiteCheckSleepBlocked
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5164)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5164)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,SiteCheckSleepBlocked"
msgid "경찰이 온다고 했잖아. 옥상에 가 봐야지."
msgstr "警察不是说要来吗？得去天台看看。"

#. Key:	EvictionNoticeSleepBlocked
