msgstr "401室的门开了条缝的声音"

#. Key:	HwangSpeaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6089)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6089)
