msgid "황순금"
msgstr "黄顺今"

#. Key:	Hwang401Peek
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6090)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6090)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Peek"
msgid "새벽에 나와 있었죠? 들어가서 눈 좀 붙여요."
msgstr "天没亮你就出来了吧？回屋眯一会儿。"

#. Key:	Hwang401Greeting
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6136)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6136)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Greeting"
msgid "403호 새로 온 아가씨죠? 밤엔 문 좀 살살 닫아 줘요. 여기 소리가 잘 울려서."
msgstr "你是403新搬来的姑娘吧？晚上关门轻一点，这楼里声音传得远。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6152)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6152)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP5"
msgid "물탱크 청소할 때는 배관이 꽤 시끄러워요. 그거라도 틀어 놔 봐요. 누가 뭐라 하면 내가 얘기할게요."
msgstr "清洗水箱的时候，水管响得厉害。你试试把水放出来。谁有意见，我去说。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6160)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6160)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP4"
msgid "벽이 하도 울길래 나도 똑같이 두드려 줬어요. 그랬더니 그날 밤은 조용하더라고요."
msgstr "墙一直响个不停，我也照着敲了回去。结果那天夜里就安静了。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6168)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6168)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP3"
msgid "관리인 없어요? 열쇠는 늘 책상 위에 두던데. 못 들어가게 하면 나한테 말해요."
msgstr "管理员不在？钥匙他一直放在桌上。要是不让你进，就跟我说。"

#. Key:	Hwang401AfterT7
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6176)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6176)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401AfterT7"
msgid "그날도 들었어요. 사람이 없다는데, 난 분명히 들었다니까요."
msgstr "那天我也听见了。都说那儿没人，可我明明听见了。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6187)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6187)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP2"
msgid "몇 번을 전화했는데 맨날 배관 소리래요. 장부에 적기는 했나 좀 봐 줘요."
msgstr "打了多少次电话了，他就说是水管声。你帮我看看，他到底记没记到投诉台账上。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6195)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6195)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP1"
msgid "전기 나갔으면 1층 계량기함 봐요. 검침표도 거기 붙어 있어요."
msgstr "停电了就去看一楼的电表箱。抄表记录也贴在那儿。"

#. Key:	Hwang401Neutral
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6202)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6202)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Neutral"
msgid "잠은 좀 잤어요? 물이라도 한 잔 마시고 가요."
msgstr "睡了一会儿没有？好歹喝杯水再走。"

#. Key:	Arrival401PrayerStops
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6255)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6255)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Arrival401PrayerStops"
msgid "안에서 들리던 불경 소리가 멈춘다"
msgstr "里面的念经声停了"

#. Key:	Hwang401JournalGiven
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6341)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6341)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401JournalGiven"
msgid "문고리에 걸어 둔 거 읽어 봐요. 사람이 없다는데, 난 분명히 들었다니까요."
msgstr "我挂在门把手上的东西，你看看。都说那儿没人，可我明明听见了。"

#. Key:	Hwang401SonDay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6357)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6357)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401SonDay"
msgid "이삿짐 들어오던 날, 그날이 손 있는 날이었어요."
msgstr "你搬来那天不宜搬家，老话说，那天有游魂在外面走。"

#. Key:	Hwang401DontOpen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6364)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6364)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401DontOpen"
msgid "문 두드린다고 다 열어 주는 거 아니에요."
msgstr "不是谁敲门都要开的。"

#. Key:	Hwang401Drill
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6385)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6385)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Drill"
msgid "새벽에 옥상에서 드릴 소리 났죠? 403호에 새 사람 들 때마다 그 양반이 그래요. 첫날 새벽엔 꼭 올라가요."
msgstr "凌晨天台上有电钻声吧？403室每次住进新人，那个人都这样。头一天凌晨一定会上去。"

#. Key:	YudamHwangDrillThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6405)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6405)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamHwangDrillThought"
msgid "새 사람이 들 때마다? 뭘 막으러 올라가나?"
msgstr "每次有新人住进来？他上去是要堵什么？"

#. Key:	Hwang401DarkWarning
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6418)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6418)
