msgstr "天还没亮的时候，在暗处要是看见什么，别盯着看。"

#. Key:	YudamToHwangAnswer
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6462)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6462)
