msgstr "哎哟……原来那是你哥哥啊？"

#. Key:	Hwang401Permission
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6479)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6479)
