msgstr "［管理室的门打开的声音］"

#. Key:	CaptionMokStopped
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(886)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(886)
