msgid "[발소리가 빨라진다]"
msgstr "［脚步声变快了］"

#. Key:	EpilogueDoorNote1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1001)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1001)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueDoorNote1"
msgid "붙어 있던 쪽지는 다 떼어지고, 하늘색 쪽지 한 장이 새로 붙어 있다."
msgstr "原来贴着的纸条都被撕掉了，新贴上了一张淡蓝色的便条。"

#. Key:	EpilogueDoorNote2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1005)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1005)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueDoorNote2"
msgid "그동안 시끄럽다고만 해서 죄송합니다. 303호"
msgstr "之前只会嫌你吵，真对不起。303室"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1019)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1019)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews1"
msgid "무영로 다세대주택 벽체에서 남성 유해 발견 … 실종 1년 만"
msgstr "无影路一住宅楼墙内发现男性遗骸……失踪已满一年"

#. Key:	EpilogueNewsMokB
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1028)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1028)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNewsMokB"
msgid "건물주 목씨 소재 파악 중… 관리실 비운 채 연락 끊겨"
msgstr "房东睦某下落不明……管理室人去楼空，本人失联"

#. Key:	EpilogueNewsMokA
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1032)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1032)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNewsMokA"
msgid "경찰, 관리실에 있던 건물주 목씨 상대로 사건 경위 조사"
msgstr "警方就事发经过询问当时在管理室的房东睦某"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews3Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1041)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1041)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews3Seen"
msgid "관리실 안쪽 방은 방음 시공돼 있었다"
msgstr "管理室里屋做过隔音处理"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1048)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1048)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews3"
