#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1059)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews4Recorder"
msgid "전 세입자 서모씨는 경찰에 출석해 유족이 제출한 녹음기가 자신의 것이라고 인정했다"
msgstr "前租客徐某到案后承认，家属提交的录音笔是他的"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews4Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1069)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1069)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews4Seen"
msgid "전 세입자 서모씨는 “그 뒤로 새벽마다 깼다”며 출석 의사를 밝혔다"
msgstr "前租客徐某称“那之后每天凌晨都会醒”，表示愿意到案说明情况"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1076)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1076)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews4"
msgid "전 세입자 서모씨는 변호인을 통해 출석 의사를 밝혔다"
msgstr "前租客徐某通过律师表示愿意到案说明情况"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews6Recorder
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1087)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1087)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews6Recorder"
