msgstr "该楼的监控录像机被发现时，存储硬盘已被拆走"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews6Calendar
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1096)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1096)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews6Calendar"
