#. Key:	EpilogueNews5Roster
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1117)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1117)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews5Roster"
