msgstr "附近便利店店员陈述了案发当天值夜班时听到的声音"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews5Parcel
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1125)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1125)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews5Parcel"
msgid "인근 편의점 직원은 실종자의 택배를 건물주가 찾아갔다고 진술했다"
msgstr "附近便利店店员称，失踪者的快递曾被房东取走"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1132)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1132)
