msgstr "［敲两下栏杆的声音］"

#. Key:	EpilogueNewsHeadingB
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(790)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(790)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNewsHeadingB"
