msgstr "那天凌晨，303室的邻居听到砸墙声，没有上楼，而是拨了119"

#. Key:	EpilogueCardB
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(808)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(808)
