msgstr "哥用过的工作单还在这儿。"

#. Key:	EpilogueWorkshop2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(841)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(841)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueWorkshop2"
