msgid "낮에 정우 씨한테 보여 주자."
msgstr "白天拿给正宇看看。"

#. Key:	P2ContradictionThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1357)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1357)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,P2ContradictionThought"
msgid "26일에 짐을 다 뺐다는데, 벽 두드리는 소리는 31일까지 났어. 그때도 위에 누가 있었던 거야."
msgstr "说是26号就把东西全清走了，可墙里的敲击声一直响到31号。那时候上面还有人。"

#. Key:	LeftoverWakeCreak
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1370)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1370)
