msgid "[스위치 켜는 소리]"
msgstr "［按下开关的声音］"

#. Key:	LeftoverWakeThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1379)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1379)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverWakeThought"
msgid "아저씨가 깼어. 숨어야 해."
msgstr "管理员醒了。得躲起来。"

#. Key:	LeftoverErrandOut
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1419)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1419)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverErrandOut"
msgid "필로티 쪽으로 나갔어. 안쪽 방 문이 열려 있어."
msgstr "他往架空层那边去了。里屋的门开着。"

#. Key:	LeftoverErrandBack
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1429)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1429)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverErrandBack"
msgid "손수레 소리가 이쪽으로 와. 나가야 해."
msgstr "手推车的声音往这边来了。得出去。"

#. Key:	N2ReturnThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1498)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1498)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,N2ReturnThought"
msgid "이제 403호까지 올라가야 해."
msgstr "现在得上楼回403室。"

#. Key:	LeftoverNoticePrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1546)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1546)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNoticePrompt"
msgid "수거 안내 읽기"
msgstr "看清运通知"

#. Key:	LeftoverNoticeTitle
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1548)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1548)
