msgid "대형 폐기물 수거 안내"
msgstr "大件垃圾清运通知"

#. Key:	LeftoverNotice1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1550)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1550)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNotice1"
msgid "건물 안에 주인 없이 남은 짐을 한꺼번에 처리합니다."
msgstr "楼内无主遗留物品将统一处理。"

#. Key:	LeftoverNotice2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1552)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1552)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNotice2"
msgid "수거일: 다음 주 월요일 오전 [두 줄 그어 지움]"
msgstr "清运日：下周一上午［用两道线划掉］"

#. Key:	LeftoverNotice3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1553)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1553)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNotice3"
