msgstr "要丢弃的物品，请最迟于前一天晚上放到架空层堆放处。"

#. Key:	LeftoverNotice5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1556)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1556)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNotice5"
msgid "찾아갈 짐이 있으면 관리실에 말씀해 주세요.  -관리인"
msgstr "如有要取回的物品，请告知管理室。  -管理员"

#. Key:	LeftoverHoldDoorPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1575)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1575)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverHoldDoorPrompt"
msgid "문 잡아 주기"
msgstr "帮忙扶住门"

