#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1592)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1592)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverNoticeThought"
