msgstr "202室"

#. Key:	LeftoverJeongwooAlone
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1646)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1646)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverJeongwooAlone"
