#. Key:	LeftoverJeongwooThanks
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1649)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1649)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverJeongwooThanks"
