#. Key:	LeftoverTruckCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1670)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1670)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverTruckCaption"
