#. Key:	LeftoverEmptiedThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1674)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverDirector.cpp(1674)
