#. Key:	LeftoverFitNoRoom
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1412)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1412)
