msgstr "这个位置放不进去。"

#. Key:	LeftoverClampLiftCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1444)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1444)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverClampLiftCaption"
