#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1485)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1485)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverClampSeatCaption"
msgid "[고정쇠가 딸깍 물리는 소리]"
msgstr "［固定夹咔哒一声扣上了］"

#. Key:	LeftoverAssembledThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1491)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1491)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverAssembledThought"
msgid "다 맞았어. 한 장짜리 덮개였네."
msgstr "全对上了。原来是一整块盖板。"

#. Key:	LeftoverFlipThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1503)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1503)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverFlipThought"
msgid "얼룩이 대각선으로 이어져. 물이 위에서 새어 내려온 자국이야."
msgstr "污渍是斜着连下来的。是水从上面渗下来留的印子。"

#. Key:	LeftoverUnknownVoice
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(151)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(151)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverUnknownVoice"
msgid "302호 안"
msgstr "302室里"

#. Key:	LeftoverVentThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1520)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1520)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverVentThought"
msgid "통풍구를 방음재로 쑤셔 막고 그 위에 방수막을 덮었어."
msgstr "用隔音棉把通风口塞死了，上面又蒙了一层防水膜。"

#. Key:	LeftoverCoverTakeThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1609)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1609)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverCoverTakeThought"
msgid "이만한 덧판을 어디서 봤는데."
msgstr "这么大的封板，我在哪儿见过。"

#. Key:	LeftoverCoverTakeUnseen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1610)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1610)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverCoverTakeUnseen"
msgid "네 귀퉁이에 나사 구멍이 있어. 어딘가에 박혀 있던 거야."
msgstr "四个角都有螺丝孔。原本是钉在某个地方的。"

#. Key:	LeftoverSiteMatch1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1626)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1626)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverSiteMatch1"
msgid "나사 자리도 잘린 면도 맞아. 원래 여기 달려 있던 덮개야."
msgstr "螺丝孔和切口都对得上。这块盖板原来就装在这儿。"

#. Key:	LeftoverSiteMatch2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1629)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1629)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverSiteMatch2"
msgid "덮개 나사 자리 위로 덧판 나사가 박혔어. 덮개를 떼어 간 다음에 막은 거야."
msgstr "封板的螺丝就钉在盖板的螺丝孔上面。是先拆走盖板，再封起来的。"

#. Key:	LeftoverDeliveredBoxPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1711)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1711)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverDeliveredBoxPrompt"
msgid "상자 들여놓기"
msgstr "把箱子搬进屋"

#. Key:	LeftoverDeliveredBoxThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1733)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(1733)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverDeliveredBoxThought"
msgid "정우 씨가 표시해 둔 그 상자야. 안에 오빠 공구 주머니가 있어."
msgstr "是正宇做了记号的那个箱子。里面有我哥的工具袋。"

#. Key:	LeftoverWedgePickPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(227)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(227)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverWedgePickPrompt"
msgid "나무 쐐기 줍기"
msgstr "捡起木楔"

#. Key:	LeftoverWedgePlacePrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(232)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(232)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverWedgePlacePrompt"
msgid "판 밑에 쐐기 끼우기"
msgstr "把木楔塞到板子底下"

#. Key:	LeftoverWardrobePrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(242)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(242)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverWardrobePrompt"
msgid "장롱 밀기"
msgstr "推开衣柜"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoardLiftPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(244)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(244)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoardLiftPrompt"
msgid "판 세워 받치기"
msgstr "把板子扶起来撑住"

#. Key:	LeftoverSackPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(246)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(246)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverSackPrompt"
msgid "마대 열어 보기"
msgstr "打开编织袋看看"

#. Key:	LeftoverDohaPullPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(250)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(250)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverDohaPullPrompt"
msgid "끼인 상자 당기기"
msgstr "拉出卡住的箱子"

#. Key:	LeftoverJeongwooPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(254)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(254)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverJeongwooPrompt"
msgid "정우에게 말 걸기"
msgstr "跟正宇搭话"

#. Key:	LeftoverLabel303Prompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(257)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(257)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverLabel303Prompt"
msgid "딱지 들춰 보기"
msgstr "掀开标签看看"

#. Key:	LeftoverDohaNamePrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(260)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(260)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverDohaNamePrompt"
msgid "상자 이름표 보기"
msgstr "看箱子上的名字"

#. Key:	LeftoverJeongwooText
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(527)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(527)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverJeongwooText"
msgid "[04:12] 302호 짐 빼러 들어왔는데 상자가 판에 끼어서 안 빠지네요. 조금만 더 해 보고 갈게요."
msgstr "[04:12] 我进302搬东西，箱子被板子卡住了，拽不出来。我再试一会儿就走。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoardKnockCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(546)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(546)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoardKnockCaption"
msgid "[302호 안에서 판을 두드리는 소리]"
msgstr "［302室里传来敲板子的声音］"

#. Key:	LeftoverTrappedCall
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(547)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(547)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverTrappedCall"
msgid "거기 누구 있어요? 판에 끼었어요."
msgstr "外面有人吗？我被板子卡住了。"

#. Key:	LeftoverDohaNameThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(573)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(573)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverDohaNameThought"
msgid "백도하. 오빠 글씨야."
msgstr "白道夏。是哥的字。"

#. Key:	LeftoverKeepBox
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(576)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(576)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverKeepBox"
msgid "잠깐만요. 이 상자는 두세요. 오빠 이름이 있어요."
msgstr "等一下，这个箱子先留着。上面有我哥的名字。"

#. Key:	LeftoverMarkBox
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(577)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(577)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverMarkBox"
msgid "그럼 이건 따로 빼 둘게요. 버리지 말라고 표시해 놓을게요."
msgstr "那这个我先单独放一边，做个记号，免得被扔了。"

#. Key:	LeftoverTrappedFallen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(591)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(591)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverTrappedFallen"
msgid "판이 더 내려왔어요. 밑동이 자꾸 밀려요."
msgstr "板子又压下来了。底下一直在往外滑。"

#. Key:	LeftoverTrappedTalk
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(592)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(592)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverTrappedTalk"
msgid "상자 빼다가 판이 넘어왔어요. 벽에 붙은 게 밀어요."
msgstr "我搬箱子，板子就倒过来了。墙上那东西在推。"

#. Key:	LeftoverWedgePicked
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(601)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(601)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverWedgePicked"
msgid "문 고이는 나무 쐐기야."
msgstr "是挡门用的木楔。"

#. Key:	LeftoverLabel303Thought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(631)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(631)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverLabel303Thought"
msgid "딱지 밑에 303호가 써 붙인 게 있어. 겨울까지만 맡긴다고."
msgstr "标签底下有303室写好贴上的字条。说只放到冬天。"

#. Key:	LeftoverSackThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(647)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(647)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverSackThought"
msgid "남은 조각 하나랑 금속 틀이야. 관리실에서 떼어 온 거랑 같은 막이 붙어 있어."
msgstr "最后一块碎片，还有金属框。上面的膜跟管理室拿来的那几块一样。"

#. Key:	LeftoverSackAllPieces
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(648)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(648)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverSackAllPieces"
msgid "점검구 덮개 조각 셋이랑 금속 틀이야."
msgstr "三块检修口盖板的碎片，还有金属框。"

#. Key:	LeftoverWedgeHeld
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(682)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(682)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverWedgeHeld"
msgid "물렸어. 이제 판이 안 밀려."
msgstr "卡紧了。这下板子推不动了。"

#. Key:	LeftoverWedgeSlip1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(696)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(696)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverWedgeSlip1"
msgid "장판에서 미끄러져 빠졌어."
msgstr "在地板革上滑出来了。"

#. Key:	LeftoverWedgeSlip2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(697)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(697)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverWedgeSlip2"
msgid "또 빠졌어. 장판 위라 걸릴 데가 없어."
msgstr "又滑出来了。地板革上没有能卡住的地方。"

#. Key:	LeftoverWardrobeCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(721)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(721)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverWardrobeCaption"
msgid "[장롱 다리가 장판을 긁으며 밀리는 소리]"
msgstr "［衣柜腿刮着地板革被推开的声音］"

#. Key:	LeftoverWardrobeHatch
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(752)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(752)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverWardrobeHatch"
msgid "장롱 뒤에 점검구가 있었어. 저쪽 틈보다 훨씬 커."
msgstr "衣柜后面有个检修口。比那边的缝大多了。"

#. Key:	LeftoverReleasedBraced
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(770)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(770)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverReleasedBraced"
msgid "어, 판이 풀렸어요. 밀어 볼게요."
msgstr "哎，板子松了。我推推看。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoardFallCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(779)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(779)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoardFallCaption"
msgid "[큰 판이 미끄러지며 쾅 하고 눕는 소리]"
msgstr "［大板子一滑，哐当一声倒了下去］"

#. Key:	LeftoverFallenLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(787)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(787)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverFallenLine"
msgid "괜찮아요! 근데 판이 더 내려왔어요."
msgstr "我没事！可板子又压下来了。"

#. Key:	LeftoverFallenThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(790)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(790)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverFallenThought"
msgid "밑동이 쭉 미끄러졌어. 판이 더 누웠어."
msgstr "底部整个滑开了。板子倒得更斜了。"

#. Key:	LeftoverFreedLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(817)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(817)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverFreedLine"
msgid "살았다… 고마워요."
msgstr "得救了……谢谢你。"

#. Key:	LeftoverFreedIntro
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(824)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(824)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverFreedIntro"
msgid "살았다… 고마워요. 저 202호 정우예요."
msgstr "得救了……谢谢你。我是202的正宇。"

#. Key:	LeftoverFreedBoxLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(845)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(845)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverFreedBoxLine"
msgid "그 상자… 아직 판 밑에 걸려 있어요."
msgstr "那个箱子……还卡在板子底下。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBraceAgain
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(884)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(884)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBraceAgain"
msgid "상자요? 잠깐만요, 판 잡을게요."
msgstr "箱子？等一下，我来撑板子。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoxStuck
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(907)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(907)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoxStuck"
msgid "잠깐만요. 상자가 걸렸어요."
msgstr "等一下，箱子卡住了。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBoxStuckReply
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(908)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(908)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBoxStuckReply"
msgid "모서리가 판에 걸렸어요. 조금만 더요."
msgstr "箱角卡在板子上了。再加把劲。"

#. Key:	LeftoverPouchThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(918)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(918)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverPouchThought"
msgid "오빠 공구 주머니야. 집에 가져가자."
msgstr "是哥的工具袋。带回家吧。"

#. Key:	LeftoverLeaveBoxLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(939)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(939)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverLeaveBoxLine"
msgid "문 잡고 있을게요. 상자 뺄 거면 말해요, 판 잡아 줄게요."
msgstr "门我扶着。要拿箱子就说一声，我帮你撑着板子。"

#. Key:	LeftoverLeaveLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(940)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(940)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverLeaveLine"
msgid "문 잡고 있을게요. 더 볼 거 있으면 보고 나와요."
msgstr "门我扶着。还有要看的就看完再出来。"

#. Key:	LeftoverBraceRelease
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(953)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(953)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverBraceRelease"
msgid "판 놓을게요. 상자는 이따 다시 해요."
msgstr "板子我先放下了。箱子等会儿再弄。"

#. Key:	LeftoverByeLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(978)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(978)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverByeLine"
msgid "짐은 낮에 마저 뺄게요. 들어가세요."
msgstr "剩下的东西我白天再来搬。你回去吧。"

#. Key:	LeftoverGoAheadLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(979)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorLeftoverStorage.cpp(979)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LeftoverGoAheadLine"
msgid "저 먼저 내려갈게요. 문은 열어 둘게요. 오래 있지 마요."
msgstr "我先下去了。门给你开着。别待太久。"

#. Key:	FinalRevealShoes
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1528)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1528)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FinalRevealShoes"
msgid "오빠…"
msgstr "哥……"

#. Key:	FinalRevealKnockCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1684)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1684)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FinalRevealKnockCaption"
msgid "멀리서 두 번 두드리는 소리"
msgstr "远处传来两下敲击声"

#. Key:	MokHansooFinalLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1729)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1729)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,MokHansooFinalLine"
msgid "망치 내려놔요. 거기서 나와. 내가 처리할 테니까."
msgstr "把锤子放下。出来，剩下的我来处理。"

#. Key:	MokHansooName
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1735)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1735)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,MokHansooName"
msgid "목한수"
msgstr "睦汉洙"

#. Key:	MokHansooCoverReply
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1747)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1747)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,MokHansooCoverReply"
msgid "그거 내려놔요. 공사하고 남은 거라니까."
msgstr "把那个放下。都说了是施工剩下的。"

#. Key:	YudamName
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1756)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1756)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamName"
