msgstr "401室 黄顺今 声音记录"

#. Key:	Journal1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1034)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1034)
