msgstr "7/27  四点半左右又醒了。楼上五下。管理室没人接电话。"

#. Key:	Journal2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1035)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1035)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal2"
