msgstr "7/28  又是五下。没昨天有劲。"

#. Key:	Journal3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1036)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1036)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal3"
