msgstr "7/29  墙响得太厉害，我也敲了回去。照那边的敲法，两下，停一下，再一下。这么一敲，就安静了。是人吗？"

#. Key:	Journal4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1037)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1037)
