msgstr "7/30  听到四下。一开水龙头就听不见了。"

#. Key:	Journal5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1038)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1038)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal5"
msgid "7/31  오늘은 세 번. 귀가 먹은 건지."
msgstr "7/31  今天三下。是我耳朵背了？"

#. Key:	Journal6
