msgid "아직 적어 둔 게 없다."
msgstr "还什么都没记下。"

#. Key:	AudioCalibrationTitle
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(7624)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(7624)
msgctxt "IGHUD,AudioCalibrationTitle"
msgid "소리와 밝기"
msgstr "声音与亮度"

#. Key:	AudioCalibrationFirstRunSubtitle
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(7631)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(7631)
msgctxt "IGHUD,AudioCalibrationFirstRunSubtitle"
msgid "시작하기 전에 소리 크기와 화면 밝기를 맞춰 주세요."
msgstr "开始之前，请先调好音量和画面亮度。"

#. Key:	AudioCalibrationSubtitle
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(7632)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(7632)
msgctxt "IGHUD,AudioCalibrationSubtitle"
msgid "헤드폰이나 모니터를 바꿨다면 다시 맞춰 주세요."
msgstr "如果换了耳机或显示器，请重新调整。"

#. Key:	AudioCalibrationKnockLabel
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(7665)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(7665)
msgctxt "IGHUD,AudioCalibrationKnockLabel"
msgid "위층에서 두드리는 소리"
msgstr "楼上的敲击声"

#. Key:	AudioCalibrationKnockInstruction
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(7674)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(7674)
msgctxt "IGHUD,AudioCalibrationKnockInstruction"
msgid "두드리는 소리가 잘 들리면서\n귀에 부담이 없는 크기로 맞춰 주세요."
msgstr "请调到能听清敲击声、\n又不会觉得刺耳的音量。"

#. Key:	AudioCalibrationShadowLabel
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(7701)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(7701)
msgctxt "IGHUD,AudioCalibrationShadowLabel"
msgid "어두운 화면 확인"
msgstr "暗部检查"

#. Key:	AudioCalibrationShadowInstruction
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(7710)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(7710)
msgctxt "IGHUD,AudioCalibrationShadowInstruction"
msgid "가운데 칸이 희미하게 보이도록 맞춰 주세요.\n왼쪽 칸은 배경과 구분되지 않아야 합니다."
msgstr "调到中间的方块隐约可见。\n左边的方块应看不出与背景的区别。"

#. Key:	AudioCal.MasterVolume
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(7745)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(7745)
msgctxt "IGHUD,AudioCal.MasterVolume"
msgid "전체 소리"
msgstr "主音量"

